{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "cc199ee61d66e794de5a5e35c7df4daff254805e106283e48cba18670d98a7b4", "ja": "はい、この満月です♪\n今日が一番綺麗に見える日だって聞いて……。", "zh": "对，就是这轮满月♪\n我听说今天是看起来最美的日子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "e56dc48facb6f10d9a4c1feec55c14d6f6e029621ce5920d070f821dd327b1a7", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒に見たくて、\n連れてきちゃいました♪", "zh": "想和{$P$}先生一起看，\n就把你带过来啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "05eec1b3918bb1d0a714dc636476269d97c7b104f2ef3c5ed4088afa094bcdc5", "ja": "はは、そうだったか。\nそれにしても、綺麗な月夜だな！", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。\n话说回来，今晚的月色真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "7994036720ad643e4247c4bb686d9b7ebc70cb8bf22b54404df58228aca05813", "ja": "そうですね。……こうして眺めていると\nこの前のライブのことを思い出しちゃいます。", "zh": "是啊。……这样望着月亮，\n就会想起前阵子的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1007_p", "source_sha256": "80e48d92ded2bf6f386122399ae245dfc817a6fe1961a57e6ff8aa5a99117ab6", "ja": "この前の……ああ、お月見ライブのことか。\n美奈子のウサギ姿が可愛いって、大好評だったな！", "zh": "之前的……啊，你说的是赏月演唱会吧。\n美奈子扮成兔子的样子很可爱，大家都赞不绝口呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "ce2bdd48152f7e3d84046c49fd0912af266bfacd9234825dc6299b24e1519158", "ja": "えぇっ？　も、もう、{$P$}さん、\nそんなことないですよ～！", "zh": "诶？不、不对，{$P$}先生，才没有那回事呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0c41dc3642f34d2e9120c4f02cee2bf2c0f7d834dd3035b288a38b867772cfbe", "ja": "本当だよ。元気いっぱい飛び跳ねる姿をみて、\nみんなも俺も、元気をもらったんだ。", "zh": "真的哦。看着你精神十足地蹦蹦跳跳，大家和我都从中获得了活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "88df23b1bbff1f5d74d89044c23b329ebc330d481047c711f507904a7e05ef75", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？\nそう言ってもらえるなら……嬉しいです♪", "zh": "真、真的呀？\n你能这么说……我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "3ec1b97515c73a9575efc1b8d07601099abe18a84d567f0805873a8f6b9d1ad9", "ja": "あ、でも。私からの元気のおすそ分けは、\nライブの時だけじゃないですよ？", "zh": "啊，不过，我分享给你的活力，可不只是在演唱会的时候哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d4d329b3f70eaec316e16399002d7d92c4a4f648732904888cb6034acd2901e2", "ja": "んっ？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0423_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "fa8b192c3ecdb066151d8f873d4f1184df24d36251d83f285d69342108ea247f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n最近ずっと忙しそうにしてるじゃないですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n最近不是一直都很忙碌的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
